'''''Heir to the Jedi''''' is a [[canon]] novel written by [[Kevin Hearne]]. The book was originally intended for the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] novel series ''[[Star Wars: Empire and Rebellion]]'', but it was published as a stand-alone story after [[Lucasfilm]]'s continuity relaunch in [[2014]]. ''Heir to the Jedi'' was published on [[March 3]], [[2015]] by [[Del Rey]], and a paperback edition was released on [[November 24]], 2015. An [[Heir to the Jedi (audiobook)|unabridged audiobook]] narrated by [[Marc Thompson]] was also released.
